[(can you|can we|let's)] (begin|start|initiate|activate|enable) [taking] dictation [mode] (named|as|for|with [the] name) {name}
[(can you|can we|let's)] (begin|start|initiate|activate|enable) (taking notes|jotting down notes|note-taking|note-making|note compilation)
[(can you|can we|let's)] (begin|start|initiate|activate|enable) (taking notes|jotting down notes|note-taking|note-making|note compilation) (named|as|for|with [the] name) {name}
[(can you|can we|let's)] (begin|start|initiate|activate|enable) (capturing text|text capturing|text capture) [mode]
[(can you|can we|let's)] (begin|start|initiate|activate|enable) (capturing text|text capturing|text capture) [mode] (named|as|for|with [the] name) {name}
[(can you|can we|let's)] (begin|start|initiate|activate|enable) [text] transcription [mode|feature]
[(can you|can we|let's)] (begin|start|initiate|activate|enable) [text] transcription [mode|feature] (named|as|for|with [the] name) {name}
[(can you|can we|let's)] (begin|start|initiate|activate|enable) transcribing [text|audio]
[(can you|can we|let's)] (begin|start|initiate|activate|enable) transcribing [text|audio] (named|as) {name}
[(can you|can we|let's)] (begin|start|initiate|activate|enable) (recording|writing) (text|words)
[(can you|can we|let's)] (begin|start|initiate|activate|enable) (recording|writing) (text|words) (named|as|for|with [the] name) {name}
